      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1757926068455,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Splitwise\n\n- User should be able to log a payment, price, people involved (can be 1:1 or group expenses)\n- User should be able to see all the logs of payments\n- User should be able to create a group and log the payments for that group.\n- User should be able to manage splits for every person involved in payment\n- User should be able to delete the payment log\n- Handle multiple amount split strategies\n- Should enable debt simplification feature that helps to reduce the number of transactions to settle up.\n- Partial Payments should be supported.\n- Keep a record of all expenses to see history.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Splitwise\n\n- User should be able to log a payment, price, people involved (can be 1:1 or group expenses)\n- User should be able to see all the logs of payments\n- User should be able to create a group and log the payments for that group.\n- User should be able to manage splits for every person involved in payment\n- User should be able to delete the payment log\n- Handle multiple amount split strategies\n- Should enable debt simplification feature that helps to reduce the number of transactions to settle up.\n- Partial Payments should be supported.\n- Keep a record of all expenses to see history.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
